<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
<meta content="#050505" name="theme-color"/>
<link href="data:image/png;base64," rel="icon" type="image/png"/>
<link href="data:image/png;base64," rel="apple-touch-icon"/>
<meta content="Void Creations — digital experiences built with intention." name="description"/>
<title>VOID CREATIONS — Digital, Reimagined</title>
<style>
:root{
 --cream:#f5f5f5;--void:#050505;--brown:#171717;--line:#383838;
 --muted:#a0a0a0;--ember:#ffffff;--font:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:84px}
body{margin:0;background:var(--void);color:var(--cream);font-family:var(--font);overflow-x:hidden}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button,a{ -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
::selection{background:var(--cream);color:var(--void)}
.nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;z-index:20;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:23px 5vw;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(16,9,4,.94),rgba(16,9,4,0));}
.brand{font-size:16px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
.brand-mark{width:42px;height:42px;object-fit:contain;flex-shrink:0}
.navlinks{display:flex;gap:clamp(16px,3vw,42px);align-items:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em}
.navlinks a{opacity:.78;transition:opacity .25s}
.navlinks a:hover{opacity:1}
.navlinks .nav-cta{border:1px solid var(--cream);border-radius:99px;padding:11px 17px;opacity:1}
.menu{display:none;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--cream);border-radius:50%;width:40px;height:40px;font-size:18px}
.hero{min-height:165svh;position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start;padding:125px 8vw 75px;gap:2vw;isolation:isolate;overflow:clip}
.hero-copy-wrap{position:relative;z-index:3;align-self:start;position:sticky;top:66vh;will-change:transform,opacity;max-width:850px;margin:0 auto;width:100%;grid-row:2;grid-column:1}\n.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:60vw;height:60vw;right:-14vw;top:4%;border:1px solid rgba(245,245,245,.06);border-radius:50%;z-index:-1}
.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:42vw;height:42vw;right:-5vw;top:14%;border:1px dashed rgba(245,245,245,.1);border-radius:50%;z-index:-1;animation:orbit 50s linear infinite}
.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow:before{content:"";height:1px;width:28px;background:#f5f5f5}
h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}
h1{font-size:clamp(48px,7.5vw,112px);line-height:.87;letter-spacing:-.065em;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;margin:25px 0 28px;max-width:780px}
h1 span{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--cream)}
.hero-copy{font-size:clamp(16px,1.45vw,20px);line-height:1.65;color:#c7c7c7;max-width:470px;margin-bottom:34px}
.actions{display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:15px;border-radius:99px;padding:15px 21px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:650;text-transform:uppercase;transition:transform .25s,background .25s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--brown);border:1px solid #424242}
.btn-ghost{border:1px solid rgba(245,245,245,.42)}
.arrow{font-size:16px;line-height:0}
.hero-visual{position:sticky;top:5vh;display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:62vh;width:100%;will-change:transform,opacity;transform-origin:center center;z-index:2;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}
.logo-stage{width:min(68vw,560px);aspect-ratio:1;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;animation:float 7s ease-in-out infinite;will-change:transform}
.logo-stage:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:15%;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(245,245,245,.12),rgba(255,255,255,.025) 42%,transparent 70%);filter:blur(16px)}
.logo-stage img{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:drop-shadow(0 30px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.5));}
.orbit-label{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:13%;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--muted);writing-mode:vertical-rl;text-transform:uppercase}
.hero-foot{position:absolute;bottom:28px;left:8vw;right:8vw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase}
.scroll-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.scroll-mark:before{content:"";width:35px;border-top:1px dashed var(--muted)}
.section{padding:125px 8vw;position:relative}
.section-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:35px;margin-bottom:62px}
.section h2{font-size:clamp(38px,5.4vw,74px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:.92;text-transform:uppercase;margin:18px 0 0}
.section h2 span{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--cream)}
.section-intro{max-width:390px;color:#b5b5b5;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0}
.divider{border:0;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);margin:0 8vw}
.services{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.service{padding:28px 24px 30px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);min-height:240px;position:relative;transition:background .25s}
.service+.service{padding-left:24px;border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
.service-num{font-size:10px;color:var(--ember);letter-spacing:.14em}
.service h3{font-size:22px;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;margin:44px 0 14px;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.service p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#b5b5b5;max-width:300px;margin:0}
.service .service-arrow{position:absolute;right:20px;top:25px;color:var(--muted);font-size:20px}

.projects-section{padding-top:120px;padding-bottom:125px}
.project-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}
.project-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0b0b0b;transition:transform .35s ease,border-color .35s ease}
.project-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:#777}
.project-preview{min-height:270px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:25px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.project-preview.benevolant{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 30%,#333 0%,#171717 38%,#090909 78%)}
.project-preview.ger{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 35%,#292929 0%,#111 45%,#080808 80%)}
.project-preview.creator{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 25% 25%,#303030 0%,#151515 42%,#080808 85%)}
.preview-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d0d0d0;position:relative;z-index:2}
.preview-wordmark{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,52px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:.9;text-transform:uppercase;position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:80%}
.preview-wordmark span{display:block;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px #f5f5f5}
.preview-orb{position:absolute;width:180px;height:180px;right:8%;top:20%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.32);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,.025),0 0 0 42px rgba(255,255,255,.02)}
.preview-fruit{position:absolute;right:16%;top:27%;width:105px;height:105px;border-radius:48% 52% 46% 54%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%,#eee,#8d8d8d 36%,#333 72%,#111);box-shadow:inset -13px -15px 22px #050505,0 22px 40px #0008;transform:rotate(-14deg)}
.preview-fruit:before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-12px;left:50%;width:22px;height:20px;border-radius:100% 0;background:#bdbdbd;transform:rotate(-30deg)}
.preview-code{position:absolute;right:8%;bottom:13%;width:43%;border:1px solid #4a4a4a;border-radius:8px;padding:13px;background:#090909dd;font-size:8px;line-height:2;color:#bcbcbc;letter-spacing:.08em}
.preview-code:before{content:"●  ●  ●";display:block;color:#777;border-bottom:1px solid #333;margin-bottom:7px;padding-bottom:5px}
.preview-layout{position:absolute;left:25px;right:25px;bottom:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:7px}
.preview-layout i{height:44px;border:1px solid #484848;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#242424,#0b0b0b)}
.project-info{padding:23px 24px 25px}
.project-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:15px}
.project-info h3{font-size:25px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 10px}
.project-info p{font-size:14px;color:#b5b5b5;line-height:1.7;margin:0;max-width:540px}
.project-tags{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
.project-tags span{border:1px solid #383838;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d0d0d0}
.project-live-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:22px;padding:11px 0;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid #777;transition:gap .25s ease,color .25s ease}
.project-live-link:hover{gap:16px;color:#cfcfcf}
.project-live-link .arrow{font-size:15px}
@media(max-width:850px){.project-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.project-preview{min-height:245px}.preview-wordmark{font-size:clamp(32px,8vw,52px)}}
.work-section{padding-top:120px;padding-bottom:130px}
.work-panel{min-height:440px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:clamp(24px,5vw,60px);background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 30%,#242424 0%,#111111 34%,#050505 72%)}
.work-panel:before,.work-panel:after{content:"";position:absolute;border:1px solid rgba(245,245,245,.11);border-radius:50%;aspect-ratio:1;pointer-events:none}
.work-panel:before{width:46%;right:5%;top:-22%}
.work-panel:after{width:32%;right:12%;top:-5%;border-style:dashed}
.work-content{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:550px}
.work-content h2{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,78px);margin:18px 0}
.work-content p{color:#c7c7c7;line-height:1.7;max-width:420px}
.work-stamp{position:absolute;right:7%;bottom:12%;width:115px;height:115px;border:1px dashed rgba(245,245,245,.35);border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;font-size:9px;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:.15em;transform:rotate(-12deg)}
.process{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:8vw}
.process-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.process-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:50px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.process-item .num{color:var(--ember);font-size:11px;padding-top:4px}
.process-item h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px}
.process-item p{font-size:14px;color:#b5b5b5;line-height:1.65;margin:0;max-width:470px}
.contact{padding-top:130px;padding-bottom:70px}
.contact-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:end}
.contact h2{font-size:clamp(48px,8vw,105px);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.065em;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;margin:20px 0 25px}
.contact h2 span{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--cream)}
.contact-copy{color:#b5b5b5;line-height:1.75;max-width:400px}
.contact-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px}
.contact-form label{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.contact-form input,.contact-form textarea,.contact-form select{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:10px;padding:14px 2px;background:transparent;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--cream);font:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;border-radius:0;outline:none}.contact-form input::placeholder,.contact-form textarea::placeholder{color:#a8a8a8;opacity:1}
.contact-form select option{background:var(--void)}
.contact-form input:focus,.contact-form textarea:focus,.contact-form select:focus{border-color:var(--cream)}
.contact-form textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:82px}
.contact-form button{align-self:flex-start;cursor:pointer;color:var(--cream)}
.footer{border-top:1px dashed var(--line);margin:0 8vw;padding:25px 0 32px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}
.footer-brand{color:var(--cream);font-size:12px}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .8s ease,transform .8s ease}
.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-1deg)}50%{transform:translateY(-13px) rotate(1deg)}}
@keyframes orbit{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@media(max-width:850px){
 .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:100px 7vw 95px;gap:0;min-height:165svh}.hero-visual{min-height:58vh;grid-row:1;top:4vh}.hero-copy-wrap{top:62vh}.logo-stage{width:min(75vw,360px)}.hero-copy{max-width:560px}.hero-foot{left:7vw;right:7vw}
 .section{padding:90px 7vw}.section-top{display:block;margin-bottom:40px}.section-intro{margin-top:24px}.services{grid-template-columns:1fr}.service,.service+.service{padding:24px 40px 26px 0;border-left:0;min-height:0}.service h3{margin:25px 0 10px}.service .service-arrow{right:8px;top:25px}
 .process{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.contact-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.work-panel{min-height:420px}.work-stamp{width:85px;height:85px;right:6%;bottom:7%;font-size:7px}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
 .nav{padding:15px 6vw}.brand{font-size:13px;gap:10px}.brand-mark{width:32px;height:32px}.menu{display:block}.navlinks{display:none;position:absolute;top:66px;left:5vw;right:5vw;padding:20px;background:#111111;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:20px}.navlinks.open{display:flex}.navlinks .nav-cta{text-align:center}.hero{padding-top:80px}.hero-visual{min-height:52vh;top:3vh}.hero-copy-wrap{top:57vh}.logo-stage{width:min(82vw,340px)}.logo-stage{width:min(78vw,300px)}h1{font-size:clamp(46px,15vw,75px)}.hero-foot{font-size:8px;bottom:18px}.hero-foot span:last-child{display:none}.section{padding:75px 6vw}.divider{margin:0 6vw}.work-panel{min-height:460px;padding:25px}.work-stamp{display:none}.contact{padding-top:90px}.footer{margin:0 6vw;flex-wrap:wrap}.footer span:last-child{width:100%}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}}

/* Added portfolio essentials — additive styles only */
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,72px);align-items:start;margin-top:34px}.about-panel,.quote-panel,.case-detail{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);border-radius:3px}.about-placeholder{min-height:260px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#202020,#090909);border:1px dashed #555;color:#aaa;padding:24px}.skill-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:20px}.skill-list span{border:1px solid #444;padding:8px 11px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.portfolio-extra{margin-top:0;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;grid-column:1 / -1;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);align-self:stretch}.portfolio-extra summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-height:54px;padding:16px 22px;border-top:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#bdbdbd;text-align:left}.portfolio-extra summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.portfolio-extra summary:after{content:"+";flex:0 0 auto;margin-left:auto;font-size:15px;line-height:1;color:#fff}.portfolio-extra[open] summary:after{content:"−"}.portfolio-extra p{max-width:720px;color:#bdbdbd;line-height:1.8;font-size:14px}.testimonials-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:30px}.quote-panel blockquote{margin:0;color:#ddd;line-height:1.8;font-size:14px}.quote-panel .quote-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#aaa;margin-bottom:12px}.contact-shortcuts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}.contact-shortcuts a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid #555;padding:12px 16px;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em}.about-resume-note{font-size:12px;color:#999;line-height:1.7;margin-top:14px}@media(max-width:700px){.about-grid,.testimonials-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.about-placeholder{min-height:190px}}
</style>
<style>
.projects-subheading{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:clamp(13px,1.2vw,16px);letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#bdbdbd;font-weight:500}
.project-preview.black-bison{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111 0%,#222 55%,#111 100%);min-height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}
.project-preview.black-bison .preview-wordmark{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,60px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.05em}
.project-preview.black-bison .preview-wordmark span{color:#c9c9c9}
.other-websites{margin:clamp(54px,8vw,100px) 0 0;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid #333;border-bottom:1px solid #333}
.other-websites .eyebrow{margin:0 0 16px;color:#aaa;letter-spacing:.18em}
.other-websites-coming{margin:0;font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,56px);letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:500;color:#e7e7e7}
</style></head>
<body>
<header class="nav">
<a class="brand" href="#home"><img alt="" class="brand-mark" src="data:image/png;base64,"/>VOID CREATIONS</a>
<button aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation" class="menu">☰</button>
<nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="navlinks">
<a href="#approach">APPROACH</a><a href="#about">ABOUT</a><a href="#services">SERVICES</a><a href="#projects">MY PROJECTS</a><a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">START A PROJECT ↗</a>
</nav>
</header>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="home">
<div class="hero-copy-wrap">
<div class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT DIGITAL STUDIO</div>
<h1>WE MAKE<br/>THE <span>UNSEEN</span><br/>UNMISSABLE.</h1>
<p class="hero-copy">Digital experiences with presence. Thoughtful websites, distinctive identities, and interactions designed to leave a mark.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">LET’S CREATE <span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#services">EXPLORE WHAT WE DO</a></div>
</div>
<div aria-label="Void Creations metallic logo" class="hero-visual">
<div class="logo-stage"><img alt="Void Creations metallic monogram" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></div>
<div class="orbit-label">VC — DIGITAL STUDIO / 001</div>
</div>
<div class="hero-foot"><span>DESIGN WITH INTENTION</span><span>BUILT FOR WHAT’S NEXT</span><span class="scroll-mark">SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span></div>
</section>
<hr class="divider"/>
<section class="section" id="approach">
<div class="section-top reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / THE APPROACH</div><h2>LESS NOISE.<br/><span>MORE MEANING.</span></h2></div><p class="section-intro">We believe good digital work should feel inevitable: clear in purpose, confident in form, and memorable in every detail.</p></div>
<div class="services">
<article class="service reveal"><span class="service-num">A / 001</span><span class="service-arrow">↗</span><h3>Intentional by design</h3><p>Every layout, interaction, and detail has a reason to exist. Nothing is there just to fill space.</p></article>
<article class="service reveal"><span class="service-num">B / 002</span><span class="service-arrow">↗</span><h3>Distinct by nature</h3><p>A visual language shaped around your brand, not another template dressed up as something new.</p></article>
<article class="service reveal"><span class="service-num">C / 003</span><span class="service-arrow">↗</span><h3>Made to move</h3><p>Responsive, considered, and built to feel seamless from the first scroll to the final click.</p></article>
</div>
</section>
<hr class="divider"/>
<section class="section" id="services">
<div class="section-top reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / WHAT WE DO</div><h2>IDEAS INTO<br/><span>EXPERIENCES.</span></h2></div><p class="section-intro">From the first spark to the final launch, we turn ambitious ideas into polished digital work that feels unmistakably yours.</p></div>
<div class="services">
<article class="service reveal"><span class="service-num">01</span><span class="service-arrow">↗</span><h3>Website design</h3><p>Distinctive visual systems and page experiences built around your goals and your audience.</p></article>
<article class="service reveal"><span class="service-num">02</span><span class="service-arrow">↗</span><h3>Web development</h3><p>Fast, responsive websites with refined interactions and a strong foundation across devices.</p></article>
<article class="service reveal"><span class="service-num">03</span><span class="service-arrow">↗</span><h3>Brand direction</h3><p>Digital-first identity, art direction, and visual consistency that help your brand stand apart.</p></article>
</div>
</section>
<hr class="divider"/>
