<div class="contact-wrap">
<div class="reveal"><div class="eyebrow">05 / GET IN TOUCH</div><h2>LET’S MAKE<br/><span>SOMETHING</span><br/>MATTER.</h2><p class="contact-copy">Have a project in mind? Tell us a little about it. We’ll turn the first conversation into a clear next step.</p></div>
<form class="contact-form reveal" id="contactForm" action="https://formspree.io/f/xyekblgb" method="POST">
<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New project enquiry — Void Creations"/>
<label>Your name<input name="name" placeholder="Name" required=""/></label>
